          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of a silver spherical object becoming white, bright, and elongated, apparently stationary, then duplicating and disappearing instantly: observation of a sun reflection on an airplane.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "92b3c0d336681dafd54378a9a74baeb4c8fec309a351292624a642e707e850f4"
